          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#000000\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                <b>Framing time</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>At Lex &amp; Partners</b>, our expertise spans across multiple legal disciplines:<br><br><b><u>1. Corporate &amp; Commercial Law</u></b><br>We assist companies in drafting, reviewing, and negotiating commercial agreements, mergers,<br>acquisitions, and compliance issues.<br><br>Our goal is to protect your business interests while ensuring long-term growth.<br><br><b><u>2. Civil &amp; Criminal Litigation</u></b><br>Our litigation team represents clients in civil disputes, contract breaches, personal injury claims, and<br>criminal defense.<br><br>We focus on strong case strategy, thorough research, and persuasive argumentation.<br><br><b><u>3. Real Estate &amp; Property Law</u></b><br>From property transactions to tenancy disputes, our firm provides reliable legal support to buyers,<br>sellers, and developers.<br><br><b><u>4. Family &amp; Divorce Law</u></b><br>We handle sensitive family matters with care, confidentiality, and respect — including divorce, child<br>custody, and asset division.<br><br><b><u>5. Employment Law</u></b><br>We guide both employers and employees through workplace disputes, unfair dismissals, and contractual<br>issues.<br><br><b><u>6. Intellectual Property (IP) Law</u></b><br>Our IP team protects your creative assets — trademarks, copyrights, and patents — from infringement</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article12-8",
          "_cid": "uZLwHtr7UX",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
